{"beat_id": "CH00_C01_L0086", "speaker_id": "cyanis", "text": "Five minutes.", "left": {}, "right": {}, "active_side": "none", "advance_mode": "manual", "cues": {"pause_ms": 80, "interrupt": false, "implementation_flags": ["IN_WORLD_DIALOGUE"], "source_section": "[SIX MINUTES]", "source_speaker_label": "CYANIS", "source_path": "docs/03_DIALOGUE/PRODUCTION/CHAPTER_00/C01_SIX_MINUTES_REHEARSAL_FIRST_DRAFT_A.md", "source_line": 315}},
{"beat_id": "CH00_C01_L0087", "speaker_id": "ilyra", "text": "For what?", "left": {}, "right": {}, "active_side": "none", "advance_mode": "manual", "cues": {"pause_ms": 80, "interrupt": false, "implementation_flags": ["IN_WORLD_DIALOGUE"], "source_section": "[SIX MINUTES]", "source_speaker_label": "ILYRA", "source_path": "docs/03_DIALOGUE/PRODUCTION/CHAPTER_00/C01_SIX_MINUTES_REHEARSAL_FIRST_DRAFT_A.md", "source_line": 317}},
{"beat_id": "CH00_C01_L0088", "speaker_id": "cyanis", "text": "We sit here and do absolutely nothing useful. No perimeter, no patients unless somebody actually calls, no inventory, no finding work because the silence made us nervous.", "left": {}, "right": {}, "active_side": "none", "advance_mode": "manual", "cues": {"pause_ms": 80, "interrupt": false, "implementation_flags": ["IN_WORLD_DIALOGUE"], "source_section": "[SIX MINUTES]", "source_speaker_label": "CYANIS", "source_path": "docs/03_DIALOGUE/PRODUCTION/CHAPTER_00/C01_SIX_MINUTES_REHEARSAL_FIRST_DRAFT_A.md", "source_line": 319}},
{"beat_id": "CH00_C01_L0089", "speaker_id": "ilyra", "text": "Six.", "left": {}, "right": {}, "active_side": "none", "advance_mode": "manual", "cues": {"pause_ms": 80, "interrupt": false, "implementation_flags": ["IN_WORLD_DIALOGUE"], "source_section": "[SIX MINUTES]", "source_speaker_label": "ILYRA", "source_path": "docs/03_DIALOGUE/PRODUCTION/CHAPTER_00/C01_SIX_MINUTES_REHEARSAL_FIRST_DRAFT_A.md", "source_line": 323}},
{"beat_id": "CH00_C01_L0090", "speaker_id": "cyanis", "text": "Why six?", "left": {}, "right": {}, "active_side": "none", "advance_mode": "manual", "cues": {"pause_ms": 80, "interrupt": false, "implementation_flags": ["IN_WORLD_DIALOGUE"], "source_section": "[SIX MINUTES]", "source_speaker_label": "CYANIS", "source_path": "docs/03_DIALOGUE/PRODUCTION/CHAPTER_00/C01_SIX_MINUTES_REHEARSAL_FIRST_DRAFT_A.md", "source_line": 325}},
{"beat_id": "CH00_C01_L0091", "speaker_id": "ilyra", "text": "Five sounds planned. Five sounds like you picked a respectable little unit, turned resting into a task, and intend to congratulate yourself when you complete it.", "left": {}, "right": {}, "active_side": "none", "advance_mode": "manual", "cues": {"pause_ms": 80, "interrupt": false, "implementation_flags": ["IN_WORLD_DIALOGUE"], "source_section": "[SIX MINUTES]", "source_speaker_label": "ILYRA", "source_path": "docs/03_DIALOGUE/PRODUCTION/CHAPTER_00/C01_SIX_MINUTES_REHEARSAL_FIRST_DRAFT_A.md", "source_line": 327}},
{"beat_id": "CH00_C01_L0092", "speaker_id": "cyanis", "text": "That's uncomfortably plausible.", "left": {}, "right": {}, "active_side": "none", "advance_mode": "manual", "cues": {"pause_ms": 80, "interrupt": false, "implementation_flags": ["IN_WORLD_DIALOGUE"], "source_section": "[SIX MINUTES]", "source_speaker_label": "CYANIS", "source_path": "docs/03_DIALOGUE/PRODUCTION/CHAPTER_00/C01_SIX_MINUTES_REHEARSAL_FIRST_DRAFT_A.md", "source_line": 331}},
{"beat_id": "CH00_C01_L0093", "speaker_id": "ilyra", "text": "Six is stupid enough that it can't pretend to be efficient.", "left": {}, "right": {}, "active_side": "none", "advance_mode": "manual", "cues": {"pause_ms": 80, "interrupt": false, "implementation_flags": ["IN_WORLD_DIALOGUE"], "source_section": "[SIX MINUTES]", "source_speaker_label": "ILYRA", "source_path": "docs/03_DIALOGUE/PRODUCTION/CHAPTER_00/C01_SIX_MINUTES_REHEARSAL_FIRST_DRAFT_A.md", "source_line": 333}},
{"beat_id": "CH00_C01_L0094", "speaker_id": "cyanis", "text": "Six minutes of aggressively unplanned nothing, then.", "left": {}, "right": {}, "active_side": "none", "advance_mode": "manual", "cues": {"pause_ms": 80, "interrupt": false, "implementation_flags": ["IN_WORLD_DIALOGUE"], "source_section": "[SIX MINUTES]", "source_speaker_label": "CYANIS", "source_path": "docs/03_DIALOGUE/PRODUCTION/CHAPTER_00/C01_SIX_MINUTES_REHEARSAL_FIRST_DRAFT_A.md", "source_line": 335}},
{"beat_id": "CH00_C01_L0095", "speaker_id": "ilyra", "text": "You just made it sound like work again.", "left": {}, "right": {}, "active_side": "none", "advance_mode": "manual", "cues": {"pause_ms": 80, "interrupt": false, "implementation_flags": ["IN_WORLD_DIALOGUE"], "source_section": "[SIX MINUTES]", "source_speaker_label": "ILYRA", "source_path": "docs/03_DIALOGUE/PRODUCTION/CHAPTER_00/C01_SIX_MINUTES_REHEARSAL_FIRST_DRAFT_A.md", "source_line": 337}},
{"beat_id": "CH00_C01_L0096", "speaker_id": "cyanis", "text": "Right. Sorry.", "left": {}, "right": {}, "active_side": "none", "advance_mode": "manual", "cues": {"pause_ms": 80, "interrupt": false, "implementation_flags": ["IN_WORLD_DIALOGUE"], "source_section": "[SIX MINUTES]", "source_speaker_label": "CYANIS", "source_path": "docs/03_DIALOGUE/PRODUCTION/CHAPTER_00/C01_SIX_MINUTES_REHEARSAL_FIRST_DRAFT_A.md", "source_line": 339}},
{"beat_id": "CH00_C01_L0097", "speaker_id": "cyanis", "text": "Six minutes.", "left": {}, "right": {}, "active_side": "none", "advance_mode": "manual", "cues": {"pause_ms": 80, "interrupt": false, "implementation_flags": ["IN_WORLD_DIALOGUE"], "source_section": "[SIX MINUTES]", "source_speaker_label": "CYANIS", "source_path": "docs/03_DIALOGUE/PRODUCTION/CHAPTER_00/C01_SIX_MINUTES_REHEARSAL_FIRST_DRAFT_A.md", "source_line": 343}},
{"beat_id": "CH00_C01_L0098", "speaker_id": "ilyra", "text": "Better.", "left": {}, "right": {}, "active_side": "none", "advance_mode": "manual", "cues": {"pause_ms": 80, "interrupt": false, "implementation_flags": ["IN_WORLD_DIALOGUE"], "source_section": "[SIX MINUTES]", "source_speaker_label": "ILYRA", "source_path": "docs/03_DIALOGUE/PRODUCTION/CHAPTER_00/C01_SIX_MINUTES_REHEARSAL_FIRST_DRAFT_A.md", "source_line": 345}}
